1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
오늘 밤 켜둘 한 줄이 필요한가요?
Don't you need one line to keep lit in your heart tonight?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,334
이디스 워튼은 말했어요.
Edith Wharton wrote,

3
00:00:06,434 --> 00:00:12,554
빛을 퍼뜨리는 길은 촛불, 아니면 거울이라고.
"There are two ways of spreading light: to be
The candle or the mirror that reflects it."

4
00:00:12,654 --> 00:00:17,529
누군가의 한 줄에 방이 환해지던 밤.
A night when one line from someone lit up the whole room.

5
00:00:17,629 --> 00:00:23,500
큰 위로가 아니어도 한 줄이면 충분할지도요.
Maybe one line is enough.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
이 한 줄은 여기 켜 둘게요.
I'll keep this line lit here.
